  "current_source_findings": [
    "At the pinned pre-04b4 revision, the direct simulation LLMClient wrapper records one final _last_usage result or text estimate per logical chat; inner JSON repair calls avoid duplicate recording. Earlier empty/retried API responses already visible to the child-local LLMMeter do not enter this wrapper aggregate.",
    "The Camel model wrapper observes model-boundary response usage and errors; those counters do not prove exact physical attempts when fallback or SDK retry work occurs underneath it.",
    "The existing durable parent importer reconciles high-water snapshots by simulation ID and meter_run_token. It cannot import absent snapshots or reconstruct physical operations omitted by a child aggregate; no current parent import replay defect is inferred from historical missing files."
